  <item>
    <title>Vol.26 想存到100万，你需要算清这几笔账？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67bd7f2505a90dfd0dbcc312</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67bd7f2505a90dfd0dbcc312</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Feb 2025 08:33:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播存钱实证首次公开，年轻人攒到100万究竟需要多久？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次“目标感超强”的四字妹妹带着满满干货前来，怎么制定合理的赚钱目标？怎么拆解目标？又怎么审视目标的完成情况？存到100万，年轻人都需要算清楚哪几笔账？赶紧听播客揭晓答案吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期高光】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="244">04:04</a> 10月8号过山车！与100w失之交臂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="548">09:08</a> 目标三步走：赚多少、花多少、存多少</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="863">14:23</a> 连续3年超额存钱？用了什么神秘法宝</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1161">19:21</a> 白活20年，第一次知道家里有多少钱！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">24:04</a> 被你遗漏的钱？原来有这么多应收款项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1932">32:12</a> 用四笔钱配置，轻松搞定投资账！</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2296">38:16</a> 3岁韭菜落泪史：基金赚钱还是股票？</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2709">45:09</a> 攒钱第一步，竟然是记好消费账！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3023">50:23</a> 避免跳槽压薪，先算清到底赚多少！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【推荐阅读】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/3006483/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/3006483/"><span>《每周工作4小时》蒂莫西·费里斯</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35295592/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35295592/"><span>《小狗钱钱》博多·舍费尔</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://youzhiyouxing.cn/n/materials/706" data-url="https://youzhiyouxing.cn/n/materials/706"><span>《详解家庭资产配置》ETF拯救世界</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Tangled Up》 Caro Emerald</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Better With You》Jeff Bernat</span></p>]]></description>
